    "tagLine": "Modern Student Living ",
    "location": "Stoneybatter Place is located in Dublin 7, a vibrant and well-connected area known for its independent cafés, restaurants, and cultural spots. TU Dublin Grangegorman is just a short walk away, while Trinity College is approximately 2km from the residence, making it easily accessible on foot, by bike, or via public transport.\n\nThe property is well served by multiple bus routes and the Luas Red Line, providing a quick and convenient commute into Dublin City Centre and across both the north and south of the city. There is also a direct bus route serving UCD, making it a practical option for students commuting to campus. Heuston Station is nearby, offering further connectivity."
