  "description": "This is a spacious, self-contained studio located on the upper floors of Stoneybatter Place. The studio combines comfort, privacy, and convenience in one large 28.5m² space.\n\nEach studio includes a double bed (1,200mm x 1,900mm) with built-in under-bed storage, wardrobe, shelving, study desk with integrated magnetic whiteboard, ergonomic chair, USB ports, adjustable bedside lighting, coat hook, and mirror.\n\nThe private living space features a dedicated seating area, en-suite bathroom, and a fully equipped kitchenette with cooking and dining facilities—ideal for independent living.\n\nPlease note: There is currently strong demand for studio apartments, and a waiting list is in operation.\n\nA weekly service charge of €65 applies, covering utilities, internet, and on-site services.\n\nPhotos are for illustrative purposes only. Room layout and furnishings may vary.",
